@startuml
title F05 - Morning activity evidence
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
autonumber
control "PIR / reed / button hardware" as Sensor
control "N01\nNode sensing" as N01
control "N05\nNode storage" as N05
control "N02\nNode radio" as N02
control "H01\nHub ingest" as H01
control "H02\nHub persistence" as H02
control "H05\nHub rules adapter" as H05
control "S02\nDeterministic rules core" as S02
control "H08\nHub cloud link" as H08
control "B07\nRead models/API" as B07
boundary "A02\nApp home" as A02
Sensor -> N01: Raw PIR/reed transition
N01 -> N01: Warm-up/debounce/retrigger qualification
N01 -> N05: Persist qualified DomainEvent before radio send
N05 -> N02: Queue retained event with stable event ID
N02 -> H01: ESP-NOW node event v1
H01 -> H02: Authorize session and commit once
H02 --> N02: DURABLE ACK only after journal commit
H02 -> H05: Apply committed event to active routine
H05 -> S02: Reduce evidence deterministically
H02 -> H08: Expose committed record for cloud replay
H08 -> B07: Cloud ingest/projection updates timeline
A02 -> B07: Read evidence and independent freshness
note over A02,Sensor: Activity evidence is household-level; it does not identify a resident or prove wellbeing.
note over Sensor,A02: Outcome - One qualified physical activity becomes one durable, traceable timeline event and suppresses the matching missing-activity decision.
@enduml
